Subject: [PATCH] wip: carried CASS HNSW patches (DistCosine + native sidecars
 + chunked insert)

Carried patches against frankensearch HEAD 10383e3d, applied on the live VPS
to make CASS HNSW build path safe. Documented in cass docs/CASS_HNSW_RECOVERY_2026_05_01.md.
Preserved before relocation from /tmp to ~/src/.
